BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Seven Samurai
DTSTART:20250730T020000Z
DTEND:20250730T055000Z
DTSTAMP:20250730T020000Z
UID:xi7Ea8rLiv
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 207 mins (3h27m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 A 16th-century farming village requests protection from seven samurai agai
 nst a horde of bandits who have warned they will return when the crops are
  ripe. A gripping three-hour ride from master filmmaker Akira Kurosawa. 4
 K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-kurosawa-
 retrospective/seven-samurai
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Together
DTSTART:20250730T023000Z
DTEND:20250730T043500Z
DTSTAMP:20250730T023000Z
UID:APfLs5ltIC
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 102 mins (1h42m)\n\nYears into their relationship\, 
 Tim and Millie (Dave Franco and Alison Brie) find themselves at a crossroa
 ds as they move to the country\, abandoning all that is familiar in their 
 lives except each other. With tensions already flaring\, a nightmarish enc
 ounter with a mysterious\, unnatural force threatens to corrupt their live
 s\, their love\, and their flesh. Note: No Open Captions on July 29. "[A] 
 delightfully unhinged spin on the body horror joint."—Kate Erbland\, In
 dieWire\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/cinema/in-theaters/together
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Uptown House 1\, 511 Queen Anne Avenue North
END:VEVENT
