BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Hidden Fortress
DTSTART:20250801T030000Z
DTEND:20250801T054000Z
DTSTAMP:20250801T030000Z
UID:HhPvuCVZOn
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 139 mins (2h19m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 Kurosawa’s first widescreen film is a delightfully comedic Samurai saga 
 starring Toshiro Mifune as a general charged with guarding his defeated cl
 an’s princess as the two smuggle royal treasure across hostile territory
 . New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/akira-ku
 rosawa-retrospective/the-hidden-fortress
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
END:VEVENT
