DTSTAMP:20250809T024500Z
UID:JSNESVwtE7
DESCRIPTION:Duration: 109 mins (1h49m)\n\nAkira Kurosawa: A Retrospective 
 A vivid\, visceral Macbeth adaptation sets Shakespeare’s definitive tale
  of ambition and duplicity in a ghostly\, fog-enshrouded landscape in feud
 al Japan. New 4K restoration.\n\nhttps://www.siff.net/programs-and-events/
 akira-kurosawa-retrospective/throne-of-blood
LOCATION:SIFF Cinema Downtown\, 2100 4th Avenue
